---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const lessons = (await getCollection('architectureLessons')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order).map((entry) => ({ id: entry.id, ...entry.data }));
const componentCatalog = (await getCollection('architectureComponents')).map((entry) => ({ id: entry.id, ...entry.data }));
const firstLesson = lessons[0];
const firstIsScenario = firstLesson?.showDiagram === false;
---

<section class="architecture-builder" aria-label="AI systems learning journey">
  <header class="builder-hero"><div><span class="builder-kicker">AI SYSTEMS · INTERACTIVE LEARNING</span><h2>How production AI systems are built.</h2><p>Follow one system from a business problem to a production-ready service. Each stage adds one engineering decision, shows the limitation it solves, and carries the architecture forward.</p></div><div class="hero-note"><span>00–20</span><p>One system<br /><em>built in stages.</em></p></div></header>

  <div class="story-layout">
    <aside class="lesson-rail"><div class="rail-heading"><span class="builder-kicker">THE SYSTEM STORY</span><small data-progress>STAGE 00</small></div><nav data-lesson-list aria-label="Architecture lessons">{lessons.map((lesson, index) => <Fragment>{lesson.order === 0 && <div class="lesson-group-label">AI system layer</div>}{lesson.order === 11 && <div class="lesson-group-label">Application layer</div>}{lesson.order === 18 && <div class="lesson-group-label">Engineering + platform layer</div>}<button type="button" class="lesson-link" data-index={index}><span>STAGE {String(lesson.order).padStart(2, '0')}</span>{lesson.title}</button></Fragment>)}</nav></aside>
    <main class="lesson-main">
      <section class="lesson-heading"><span class="builder-kicker" data-lesson-eyebrow>{firstLesson?.eyebrow}</span><h1 data-lesson-title>{firstLesson?.title}</h1><p data-lesson-summary>{firstLesson?.summary}</p></section>
      <section class="lesson-explanation"><div><span class="builder-kicker">CURRENT STATE</span><h2 data-lesson-why>{firstLesson?.why}</h2><p><span class="builder-kicker story-inline-label">THE NEXT PROBLEM</span><span data-lesson-without>{firstLesson?.without}</span></p></div><div class="lesson-details"><div><small>WHAT WE ADD</small><p data-lesson-role>{firstLesson?.role}</p></div><div><small>DESIGN TRADE-OFF</small><p data-lesson-tradeoff>{firstLesson?.tradeoff}</p></div><div class="reflection"><small>NEXT QUESTION</small><p data-lesson-question>{firstLesson?.question}</p></div></div></section>
      <section class="scenario-brief" data-scenario-brief hidden={!firstIsScenario}><span class="builder-kicker">THE BUSINESS PROBLEM</span><h2>One public chatbot, many customer questions.</h2><p>People visiting the company website should be able to ask about products and services, find approved public guidance, and get help contacting support. The first engineering task is to understand the customer job before choosing the architecture.</p><div class="scenario-example"><small>EXAMPLE VISITOR QUESTION</small><p>“Which solution fits a small retail company, and can you help me contact the right support team?”</p></div><div class="scenario-columns"><div><small>THE USER</small><p>A customer or visitor who wants a clear answer without searching through the entire website.</p></div><div><small>THE PROMISE</small><p>Helpful guidance grounded in published company information, with a clear handoff when the chatbot cannot answer.</p></div><div><small>SUCCESS</small><p>Useful, grounded, fast answers with clear escalation when confidence or authority is insufficient.</p></div><div><small>THE BOUNDARY</small><p>The assistant may help prepare a support request, but account-specific or irreversible actions remain controlled.</p></div></div></section>
      <section class="lesson-diagram-panel" data-lesson-diagram hidden={firstIsScenario}><div class="panel-label"><span>HOW THE SYSTEM FITS TOGETHER</span><span data-lesson-legend hidden></span><span>Step-by-step view</span></div><div class="diagram-toolbar"><span>Case: answer a company question and help with the next action</span><div class="zoom-controls" role="group" aria-label="Diagram zoom controls"><button type="button" data-zoom-out aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><span data-zoom-level>100%</span><button type="button" data-zoom-reset>Reset</button><button type="button" data-zoom-in aria-label="Zoom in">+</button></div></div><div class="lesson-viewport" data-lesson-viewport><div class="lesson-canvas" data-lesson-canvas><div class="lesson-stage"><svg class="lesson-edges" data-lesson-edges viewBox="0 0 1400 820" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="lesson-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto" markerUnits="strokeWidth"><path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" fill="#176b58"></path></marker></defs></svg><div class="lesson-nodes" data-lesson-nodes></div></div></div></div><div class="diagram-help"><span>request flow →</span><span>Click a component to inspect it</span><span>Scroll to explore the map</span></div></section>
      <section class="selected-note" data-selected-note hidden={firstIsScenario}><span class="builder-kicker">SELECTED COMPONENT</span><h3 data-selected-title>Start with the diagram</h3><p data-selected-copy>Each new layer exists to solve a specific problem. Select a component to see its role in the larger system.</p><div class="selected-facts"><div><small>ROLE</small><p data-selected-role>—</p></div><div><small>FAILURE TO WATCH</small><p data-selected-risk>—</p></div><div><small>TRADE-OFF</small><p data-selected-tradeoff>—</p></div></div></section>
      <section class="compound-inspector" data-compound-inspector hidden><div class="compound-inspector-head"><div><span class="builder-kicker">INSIDE THIS SYSTEM TILE</span><h3 data-compound-title>AI assistant</h3><p data-compound-copy>These components were combined into one reusable system boundary.</p></div><button type="button" data-close-compound>Back to current stage</button></div><div class="compound-tiles" data-compound-tiles></div></section>
      <div class="lesson-navigation"><button type="button" data-previous>← Previous</button><button type="button" class="next-lesson" data-next>Next layer →</button></div>
    </main>
  </div>
  <p class="builder-note">A read-only learning path for thinking through AI application architecture. The editable canvas can come later.</p>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .architecture-builder{margin-top:0}.builder-kicker{color:var(--accent);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em}.builder-hero{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px;padding:0 0 34px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.builder-hero h2{max-width:720px;margin:13px 0 10px;font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,62px);line-height:.98}.builder-hero>div:first-child p{max-width:670px;margin:0;color:#4f5a52;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;line-height:1.45}.hero-note{display:flex;gap:12px;min-width:190px;padding-top:8px}.hero-note>span{color:var(--accent);font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.hero-note p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.hero-note em{color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--serif);font-size:16px;font-style:normal}.story-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px minmax(0,1fr);gap:35px;margin-top:32px}.lesson-rail{padding-top:8px}.rail-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding-bottom:13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.rail-heading small{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.lesson-rail nav{display:grid;gap:0;margin-top:10px}.lesson-link{position:relative;padding:12px 10px 12px 18px;border:0;border-left:2px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3}.lesson-link:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:-5px;top:17px;width:7px;height:7px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;background:var(--paper)}.lesson-link.active{border-left-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);background:#dfece4}.lesson-link.active:before{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent)}.lesson-link span{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--accent);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em}.lesson-main{min-width:0}.lesson-heading{padding-bottom:26px}.lesson-heading h1{max-width:820px;margin:13px 0 12px;font-size:clamp(35px,5.2vw,65px);line-height:.98}.lesson-heading p{max-width:720px;margin:0;color:#4f5a52;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;line-height:1.45}.lesson-diagram-panel{padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#eef0e9}.panel-label,.diagram-help,.diagram-toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;color:var(--accent);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.panel-label span:last-child,.diagram-help{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0}.diagram-toolbar{align-items:center;margin-top:14px;color:#4f5a52;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0}.zoom-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.zoom-controls button{min-width:28px;padding:5px 8px;border:1px solid #a4c7ba;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;font-size:11px}.zoom-controls button:hover{background:var(--accent);color:var(--paper)}.zoom-controls span{min-width:40px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.lesson-viewport{margin-top:14px;overflow:auto;border:1px dashed #a4c7ba;background:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px,#c7d5ca 1px,transparent 0) 0 0/18px 18px,#e8ece4}.lesson-canvas{position:relative;width:1000px;height:600px}.lesson-stage{position:absolute;inset:0;width:1000px;height:600px;transform-origin:top left}.lesson-edges{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}.lesson-edge{fill:none;stroke:#176b58;stroke-width:2.3;marker-end:url(#lesson-arrow)}.lesson-edge-label{fill:#4f6e5e;font:11px Arial,sans-serif;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#e8ece4;stroke-width:6px;stroke-linejoin:round}.lesson-edge-dot{fill:#176b58;stroke:#e8ece4;stroke-width:2}.lesson-nodes{position:absolute;inset:0}.lesson-node{position:absolute;width:160px;min-height:82px;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--node-color,#87a995);border-radius:4px;background:var(--paper);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(39,76,58,.08);cursor:pointer;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);text-align:left}.lesson-node:before,.lesson-node:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:15px;height:15px;border:1px solid var(--node-color,#87a995);border-radius:50%;background:var(--paper)}.lesson-node:before{left:-9px;top:calc(50% - 8px)}.lesson-node:after{right:-9px;top:calc(50% - 8px)}.lesson-node:hover,.lesson-node.active{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(23,107,88,.18),3px 3px 0 rgba(39,76,58,.08)}.lesson-node.new-layer{background:#e1eee6}.lesson-node b,.lesson-node small,.lesson-node em{display:block}.lesson-node b{font-size:14px}.lesson-node small{margin-top:5px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.3}.lesson-node em{margin-top:10px;color:var(--node-color,#176b58);font-size:9px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.diagram-help{margin-top:12px}.selected-note{margin-top:16px;padding:18px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:#dfece4}.selected-note h3{margin:10px 0 7px;font-size:24px}.selected-note>p{max-width:760px;margin:0;color:#4f5a52;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.selected-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #a4c7ba}.selected-facts small,.lesson-details small{color:var(--accent);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em}.selected-facts p,.lesson-details p{margin:5px 0 0;color:#4f5a52;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.lesson-explanation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:30px;margin-top:16px;padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#f1f2eb}.lesson-explanation h2{max-width:560px;margin:11px 0 12px;font-size:clamp(22px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.08}.lesson-explanation>div:first-child>p{margin:0;color:#5d655d;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}.lesson-details{display:grid;gap:15px}.lesson-details>div{padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.lesson-details .reflection{padding:13px;border:1px solid #a4c7ba;background:#dfece4}.lesson-navigation{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;margin-top:18px}.lesson-navigation button{padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}.lesson-navigation button:hover,.lesson-navigation .next-lesson{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent);color:var(--paper)}.lesson-navigation button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}.builder-note{margin:17px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}
  @media(max-width:850px){.story-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lesson-rail{padding:0}.lesson-rail nav{display:flex;overflow:auto;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.lesson-link{min-width:125px;border-left:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent}.lesson-link:before{display:none}.lesson-link.active{border-bottom-color:var(--accent);background:transparent}.lesson-link span{white-space:nowrap}.lesson-explanation{grid-template-columns:1fr}.selected-facts{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.builder-hero{display:block}.hero-note{margin-top:22px}.lesson-heading h1{font-size:42px}.lesson-heading p{font-size:18px}.lesson-diagram-panel{padding:13px}.diagram-help{display:block}.diagram-help span{display:inline-block;margin:5px 12px 0 0}.selected-facts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lesson-navigation{position:sticky;bottom:0;padding:10px 0;background:var(--paper)}}
</style>

